Both files are pinned copies of the server's canonical settings contract. The
manifest's advisory notes may be shortened without changing the contract.
Re-vendor the pair together, update the commits below, then run the SiloTests scheme —
SettingsConformanceTests fails when the fixture's manifest_revision, the
vendored manifest's revision, and the generated SettingKey.revision stop
agreeing, which is the whole point of carrying the pair rather than the
fixture alone.

